        "abstract": "The paper is a powerpoint presentation on the Environment Agency's new time-series data exchange standard. The following topics are covered: the purpose of the standard; the reasons for selecting XML and its advantages; challenges faced, particularly in facing the standard; and future aspirations.",
        "keywords": {}
